{"id":1929,"date":"2015-05-21T15:39:48","date_gmt":"2015-05-21T14:39:48","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/?p=1929"},"modified":"2015-05-21T15:40:44","modified_gmt":"2015-05-21T14:40:44","slug":"trouver-lemplacement-du-fichier-de-sortie-hex-dans-arduino","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/2015\/05\/21\/trouver-lemplacement-du-fichier-de-sortie-hex-dans-arduino\/","title":{"rendered":"Trouver l&#8217;emplacement du fichier de sortie *.hex dans Arduino"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>J&rsquo;ai d\u00e9velopp\u00e9 un logiciel avec l&rsquo;environnement Arduino.<\/p>\n<p>Je d\u00e9sire mettre ce logiciel dans un hardware personnalis\u00e9 donc pas sur une carte Arduino.<\/p>\n<p>Comment trouver l&#8217;emplacement o\u00f9 se trouve le fichier hex compil\u00e9 ?<\/p>\n<p>Voici la marche \u00e0 suivre :<\/p>\n<p>1 Ouvrir l&rsquo;environnement Arduino, sous l&rsquo;onglet \u00ab\u00a0fichier\u00a0\u00bb s\u00e9lectionner l&rsquo;option \u00ab\u00a0Pr\u00e9f\u00e9rences\u00a0\u00bb :<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/Pr\u00e9f\u00e9rences.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-1930\" src=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/Pr\u00e9f\u00e9rences-257x300.png\" alt=\"Pr\u00e9f\u00e9rences\" width=\"257\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/Pr\u00e9f\u00e9rences-257x300.png 257w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/Pr\u00e9f\u00e9rences.png 322w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 257px) 100vw, 257px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>2 Cocher l&rsquo;option \u00ab\u00a0compilation\u00a0\u00bb :<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/Coche.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-1931\" src=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/Coche-300x162.png\" alt=\"Coche\" width=\"300\" height=\"162\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/Coche-300x162.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/Coche.png 444w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>3 Compiler le logiciel. Dans la fen\u00eatre de sortie, rep\u00e9rer le r\u00e9pertoire du fichier hex :<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/OUT.png\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-1932\" src=\"http:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/OUT-300x97.png\" alt=\"OUT\" width=\"300\" height=\"97\" srcset=\"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/OUT-300x97.png 300w, https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/05\/OUT.png 640w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Ensuite, vous pouvez utiliser votre programmateur et transf\u00e9rer le logiciel dans votre carte personnalis\u00e9e !<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>J&rsquo;ai d\u00e9velopp\u00e9 un logiciel avec l&rsquo;environnement Arduino. Je d\u00e9sire mettre ce logiciel dans un hardware personnalis\u00e9 donc pas sur une<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":4,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"colormag_page_container_layout":"default_layout","colormag_page_sidebar_layout":"default_layout","footnotes":""},"categories":[166],"tags":[248,170,11,21],"class_list":["post-1929","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-microclub","tag-ardui","tag-arduino","tag-hardware","tag-processeurs"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1929","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/microclub.ch\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https